      "full network    : IGRAPH DNW- 755988 1518294 -- \n",
      "+ attr: name (v), weight (e)\n",
      "filtered network: IGRAPH DNW- 5648 117270 -- \n",
      "+ attr: name (v), weight (e)\n",
