   "source": [
    "### Task 1.2\n",
    "\n",
    "Now compute the coreness of each node. What is the highest coreness in the network? For different values of k, highlight the nodes with coreness k or higher in a node-link plot (e.g. using colour, or a different node shape).\n",
    "\n",
    "#### TIPS\n",
    "\n",
    "- Look at how the network core changes varying k, e.g. if you get a single core inside the largest component, or if for some values of k you get multiple cores that are not connected to each other."
   ]
  },
