   "source": [
    "#### Notes / observations\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "Louvain on the co-sharing network gives evenly sized communities, and the largest (20 accounts) was analysed. Account 976626354 is a clear hub (degree 18, strength 52, betweenness 944). The roles are mixed, with low-volume sources that get many retweets and high-volume amplifiers. All the top accounts are activist-leaning with no skeptic tweets, and the content is Australian-focused climate news sharing (auspol, climatestrike, Morrison). This looks like a topical cluster, not coordinated behaviour. The stance label is hashtag-based, and the example tweets are only the last 2 per account, so the homogeneity and the date clustering are partly artefacts of the method.\n"
   ]
  },
