    "#### Notes / observations\n",
    "\n",
    "Being a bridge is the norm: 3,184 of 4,213 actors have ties to at least 2 other communities, which fits the roughly 50% cross-community edges seen earlier. Requiring identical community sets fragments this into 276 positions with at least 2 actors. The largest positions involve the big hub communities, such as (1,2,3,4,6,8) with 97 actors. Since the actor’s own community is excluded, these are probably members of the community missing from the signature. A looser similarity measure would give more meaningful groups\n"
   ]
